   "is_input_boundary": false,
   "is_output_boundary": false,
   "widgets_values": [
    "For consistent characters, just provide a high-resolution and highly detailed image of the face in one input — and for better performance, use a front-facing pose.\n\nThe rest will be the magic of your prompts — it depends on how you want to craft the output.\n\nTo create a custom workflow or for local setup, you can contact me:\n📧 Email: oomify@gmail.com\n📱 WhatsApp: https://wa.me/923003209004\n\nPrompt Example:\n\nYour job is to present the model in front of a velvet emerald green curtain, styled in a burnt orange raw silk kurta with antique gold gota work. A matching burnt orange chiffon dupatta is pinned gracefully, softly framing her face.\nSoft focus, centered square crop.\n\nFace must remain fully intact — no changes to features or identity."
   ],
