  {
   "id": 6,
   "type": "CLIPTextEncode",
   "category": "conditioning",
   "title": "CLIP Text Encode (Positive Prompt)",
   "mode": 0,
   "is_input_boundary": false,
   "is_output_boundary": false,
   "widgets_values": [
    "Capture a striking Russian fashion model with sharp, confident features, posed gracefully against a minimal yet dramatic backdrop — think textured charcoal wall or a low-lit, moody studio.\n\nShe wears a form-fitting, floor-length black satin gown with a plunging neckline and thigh-high slit, designed to accentuate her curves with precision. The dress features subtle gold metallic threadwork along the seams, adding quiet luxury without overwhelming the silhouette.\n\nHer hair is styled in soft waves or a sleek pulled-back bun, makeup bold but clean — smokey eyes, nude lips, sculpted cheekbones. The lighting is warm and directional, highlighting the sheen of the satin and the model’s skin.\n\nShe gazes directly into the lens — poised, powerful, and unbothered — exuding effortless sensuality.\n\nFinal crop is vertical editorial, shot in soft focus with crisp facial detail. The image should feel seductive but elevated, suitable for a Vogue or Harper’s Bazaar spread, not overtly commercial or objectifying.\n\nDo not alter the model’s face or identity."
   ],
